diagram state "Composite states and history"
[*] --> Off
Off --> Playing : power
state Playing {
  entry / spin up
  do / stream
  exit / spin down
  [*] --> Track
  Track --> Track : next / advance
  Track --> Seeking : seek
  Seeking --> Track : found
  [H]
}
Playing --> Paused : pause
Paused --> Playing[H] : resume
Playing --> Off : power
Paused --> Off : power
